# Lodestone Needle taps Traxos and puts two stun counters on it. Its untap prohibition means its untap step removes
# neither counter (CR 502.3/122.1d). Ornithopter is both artifact and creature: one OR trigger removes exactly one stun.
# Two later artifact-only casts remove the other counter, then finally untap Traxos (CR 603.2c/701.26b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Mox Sapphire
Springleaf Drum
Traxos, Scourge Eternal
Lodestone Needle
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x26

